{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nBooks are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws [[cite:obs-8363e79d7e2e124403dd6033d2caa210dc622d98 \"Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws.\"]].\n\nThe loan table specifies that novels may be borrowed for twenty-one days and this period is renewable twice [[cite:obs-ce8f7257aaa4a26f139b615777de5a0fe3b3e386 \"Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"5ad3d990d74a9006b2620f5035d4b80b77890efddc9d7c0e6f3c271c191a23bb","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the lending rule and loan duration from the loan table source with exact citations as required."}